cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-loader-mt101 in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-loader-mt101: SWIFT MT101 to ISO 20022 pain.001 records"
abstract: >-
  A loader plugin for the pain001 library that parses legacy SWIFT MT101
  Request for Transfer messages into the flat records pain001 validates and
  turns into ISO 20022 pain.001 XML, one record per transaction.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.70"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/pain001-loader-mt101"
url: "https://pain001.com"
keywords:
  - ISO 20022
  - pain.001
  - SWIFT MT101
  - MT to MX migration
  - payments
